  EnglishWord(word: 'Furtive', partOfSpeech: 'adjective', definition: 'Attempting to avoid notice or attention, typically because of guilt.', example: 'The furtive behavior of the accused raised suspicion among the investigators.', synonyms: ['secretive', 'stealthy', 'surreptitious']),

