  EnglishWord(word: 'Penal', partOfSpeech: 'adjective', definition: 'Relating to or prescribing the punishment of offenders under the legal system.', example: 'Penal statutes must be strictly construed in favour of the accused.', synonyms: ['punitive', 'disciplinary', 'corrective']),
